Forked from @mobilenext/mobile-mcp at tag 0.0.62 (commit 6c4504a, 2026-07-11),
the last release before upstream moved its device backend to `mobilecli`, which
is distributed under the Functional Source License 1.1 rather than an
open-source license. This project deliberately does not use or link that
backend.

Modifications:
  - Removed the iOS surface (ios.ts, iphone-simulator.ts, webdriver-agent.ts).
  - Removed the mobilecli client and the mobilecli-backed device implementation
    (mobilecli.ts, mobile-device.ts); this project drives adb directly.
  - Removed on-by-default telemetry to a third-party analytics endpoint.
  - Removed the Express/SSE network listener and its dependency tree
    (express, qs, commander, ajv, zod-to-json-schema); the server is stdio-only.
  - Reduced device discovery and robot resolution to Android only.
  - Added the on-device instrumentation agent and its wire protocol, the
    identity-based tool surface, action verification, polling assertions,
    composite journeys, and the environment/diagnostic tools. See
    docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.

